* bias_gen -- constant-gm (beta-multiplier) bias generator for the 8-bit
* bottom-plate ADC: current outputs to four comparator comparators, the ramp
* and the two midref_v2 buffers. GENERATED by size_bg.py; do not hand-edit.
* Every MOS: one L and one finger width, PMOS row over NMOS row (floorplan.py).
*   L 0.9 um, finger W 4 um, K 8, R 5 x 10.732 um ppolyf_u (W 1 um)
*   core 3.577 uA per branch, XMN1 gm/Id 21.9, PMOS mirror gm/Id 18.6 [P]
*   cmp sink 8 fingers: 1.681 x 1.931 uA [M]; ramp sink 8 fingers: 3.257 uA [M];
*   midref source 44 fingers: 0.868 x 12.36 uA [M]
*   135-cell requirement s_pvt 1.471 [M] x (1 + 3 sigma 4.76 % [P])
*   decaps: pb 1 pF to vdd, nb 1 pF to vss (MIM over the rows)
* Ports: vdd vss icmp0..3 (sinks, to each comparator's own pbias diode), iramp (sink,
* to the ramp's L=1u W=20u nf=10 diode), ivref ivbl (sources, to midref_buf ib).
* The simulators are the authority, not these lines.
.subckt bias_gen vdd vss icmp0 icmp1 icmp2 icmp3 iramp ivref ivbl
* ---- core: NMOS-defined beta multiplier
XMN1 nb nb vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.9u W=40u nf=10 m=1 ad=3.6p pd=41.8u as=4.32p ps=50.16u nrd=0.0045 nrs=0.0045
XMN2 pb nb ns vss nfet_03v3 L=0.9u W=80u nf=20 m=4 ad=7.2p pd=83.6u as=7.92p ps=91.96u nrd=0.00225 nrs=0.00225
XMP1 nb pb vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.9u W=56u nf=14 m=1 ad=5.04p pd=58.52u as=5.76p ps=66.88u nrd=0.003214 nrs=0.003214
XMP2 pb pb vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.9u W=56u nf=14 m=1 ad=5.04p pd=58.52u as=5.76p ps=66.88u nrd=0.003214 nrs=0.003214
XR1 ns r1 vss ppolyf_u r_width=1u r_length=10.7324u
