XOC2 icmp2 nb vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.9u W=32u nf=8 m=1 ad=2.88p pd=33.44u as=3.6p ps=41.8u nrd=0.005625 nrs=0.005625
XOC3 icmp3 nb vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.9u W=32u nf=8 m=1 ad=2.88p pd=33.44u as=3.6p ps=41.8u nrd=0.005625 nrs=0.005625
